# Deploy review

Three of the twelve checks need a decision before this ships. Everything else is
{ok:clear}.

## Blockers

:::bad Migration is not reversible
`0042_drop_legacy_users.sql` has no down step. If the rollout is rolled back, the
table is {bad:gone}. Add a down migration or gate it behind a second deploy.
:::

:::warn Config drift
{num:10} of the {num:17} keys in the deploy secret are operational flags, not
secrets. They live outside version control, so {muted:"who changed this, and
when?"} has no answer.
:::

