## What changed

```diff
+ flags moved into version control
+ OIDC role, branch-scoped
- static access keys in CI
```

## Suggested order

1. Add the down migration — {muted:blocking, ~20 min}
2. Split flags out of the secret — {muted:cheap, high value}
3. Revisit the bundle after ship — {muted:not urgent}

> Ship {num:1} and {num:2} together; {num:3} can wait a week.
